  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountable Grant to the International Centre for Asset Recovery - ICAR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project purpose is to increase the likelihood and severity of sanctions for serious and organised corruption and related crimes in Malawi. It is providing Technical Assistance through embedded expertise and strategic resources to Malawian law enforcement agencies including the Anti-Corruption Bureau (ACB), the Financial Intelligence Authority (FIA), the Director of Public Prosecution (DPP) and Fiscal and Fraud Department of the Malawi Police Service.</narrative>
  </description>
